WEBVTT

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.480
(Laughter)

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.056
And then I worked diligently

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:38.720
toward my goal of not making
progress toward my goal.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.336
I started writing
the procrastination chapter,

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.256
and one day -- I was halfway through --

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.176
I literally put it away in mid-sentence

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.536
for months.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.560
It was agony.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:53.600
But when I came back to it,
I had all sorts of new ideas.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.896
As Aaron Sorkin put it,

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.880
"You call it procrastinating.
I call it thinking."